cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software, workflow, or derived analysis in your research,
  please cite both the associated manuscript and the archived Zenodo release.

title: "Ecotype_Levy_OU_Branching_Dynamics"

abstract: >
  Reproducible computational workflows for therapy-aware multimodal ecological
  modeling of pediatric leukemia using diagnosis-anchored disease-state
  representations, frozen-space projection, and Ornstein–Uhlenbeck–Lévy–
  Branching dynamic summaries.

type: software

authors:
